1
00:00:00,229 --> 00:00:02,659
(Sheldon:)to come up with
a theory of dark matter

2
00:00:02,665 --> 00:00:04,195
(Sheldon:)that doesn't
make protons decay.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,030
(Sheldon:)I'm hoping to
finally tackle it

4
00:00:06,035 --> 00:00:08,035
by optimizing my
work environment.

5
00:00:08,037 --> 00:00:12,577
(Sheldon:)See, I've got, uh, my tea is at
the perfect sipping temperature.

6
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:15,005
(Sheldon:)Uh, I have fleece-lined
boxer shorts

7
00:00:15,011 --> 00:00:16,511
(Sheldon:)to keep my tushie toasty.

8
00:00:16,512 --> 00:00:18,042
(Sheldon:)And then, oh,
last but not least,

9
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:21,047
(Sheldon:)this inspirational cat poster,

10
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,050
(Sheldon:)improved with
the reassuring face

11
00:00:23,052 --> 00:00:25,122
(Sheldon:)of physics renegade
Richard Feynman.

12
00:00:28,224 --> 00:00:31,194
(Penny:)Is that why you had to take him
to Office Depot last night?

13
00:00:31,194 --> 00:00:33,264
(Leonard:)I don't want to talk about it.

14
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:35,700
(Leonard:)There, the place is all yours.

15
00:00:35,698 --> 00:00:36,698
(Penny:)Yeah, have fun.

16
00:00:36,699 --> 00:00:38,699
(Sheldon:)Oh, I will--
nothing more fun

17
00:00:38,701 --> 00:00:40,071
(Sheldon:)than a paradigm-shifting
evening of science.

18
00:00:40,069 --> 00:00:41,269
(scoffs)

19
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,600
(Penny:)And you thought it was
soaping me up in the shower.

20
00:00:43,606 --> 00:00:44,606
(chuckles)

21
00:00:44,607 --> 00:00:45,607
(Leonard:)Bye.

22
00:00:45,608 --> 00:00:48,108
(Leonard:)Okay.

23
